{"articleNo":"716","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=716&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 1학기 성적취소 및 이수구분 변경신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.26","hit":"17041","attachments":[{"name":"2009학년도1학기성적취소신청원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=716&attachNo=69430"},{"name":"2009학년도1학기이수구분변경원.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=716&attachNo=69431"},{"name":"폐지과목내역~.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=716&attachNo=69432"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY목각파임B'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">성적취소 및 이수구분 변경신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">2009학년도 1학기 성적취소 및 이수구분 변경에 관한 사항을 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">아래와</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> 같이 안내하오니 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">다.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">◀ 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 ▶</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">1. 성적취소 대상</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> (재학생에 한함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;가. 동일과목이 중복 취득되어 있는 성적(제한 없음)&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 현행 교육과정상 폐지된 교과목의 성적(제한 없음) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 기 이수한 교과목 중 본인이 원하는 교과목 성적(6학점 이내)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2. 이수구분 변경 대상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">가. 복수전공, 부전공, 교직과정 이수 신청 또는 취소로 인하여 이수 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 47.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -47.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;구분이 맞지 않은 경우 변경 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;예) - 일반선택과목&nbsp; ○○과목을 복수전공 필수로</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교직과정 ○○과목을&nbsp; 일반선택과목으로 변경</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 동일 학부내 타전공 일반선택 ○○과목을 전공선택으로 변경</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">2005학년도 이전 입학자로서 복학 시 공학교육</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">인증과정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">으로 선택한 학생 중 이수구분이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 맞지 않은 경우</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 42pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">3. 신청 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2009. 3. 31(화) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">～</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"> 2009. 4. 2(목)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">4. 신청 장소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">각 학부(과) 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;☞</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 테크노관(☎478-7359),디지털관(☎478-7751),글로벌관(☎478-7598)에 위치</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">5. 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">가. 성적취소 신청원 및 이수구분 변경원 각 1부(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">해당 종합학사행정실 비치</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.3pt\">)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">나. 성적증명서 1부(2009. 3. 30일 이후 발행분): 해당 과목에 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">형광펜</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 표시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">6. 기타사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">▘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">성적취소를 신청한 교과목의 성적은 학적변동(휴학, 제적)에 관계없이 삭</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">제처리</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">되며,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 삭제된 교과목의 성적은 재 인정될 수 없으므로 신중하게</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"> 신청하&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시기 바랍니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">신청원에 빠짐없이 작성하여 제출하여 함(예: 교과목코드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> 교과목코드조회: 원스톱서비스- 교과과정조회 , 개인별 원스톱서비스 - 학적 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">학적 및 각종자료조회 - 성적(본인이 이수한 교과목코드 조회 가능 )</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">▘</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">성적취소 및 이수구분 변경된 성적은 2009. 4. 24일 이후에 확인 가능</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(성적취소확인 : 원스톱로그인-학적-학적및각종자료조회-“성적정정”)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(이수구분확인 : 원스톱로그인-학적-학적및각종자료조회-“이수구분”)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▘필수 과목은 폐지된 과목(교과목코드, 과목명이 모두 동일해야만 해당 과목임)이라도 동일대체과목으로 지정되어 있다면 이수해야 됨.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">☞ </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">학적부에 사진(학사서비스센터 ☎478-7066)이 없거나 학적</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">부기재사항(영문명,한자명, 주소, e-mail, 연락처)</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">이&nbsp;정확하지 않은 경우&nbsp;성적열람이 불가능하오니&nbsp;</font></span></strong><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">반</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><font face=\"굴림체\">드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</font></span></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><br></font></span></span></p>\n<font face=\"굴림체\"></font>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">2009. 3. 26.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
